cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these reproduction materials, please cite this repository."
title: "Radial Consolidation: figure and analysis reproduction"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and bundled research data that reconstruct the figures and
  tables of the pre-submission manuscript "Radial Consolidation: Constraining
  Post-Formation Kernel Drift in Spiking Neural Networks". This package does
  not retrain the original networks. No publication DOI is assigned.
type: software
